		{"id":"09c2428d8f408f7c","type":"text","text":"### SentinelCoordinator\n- Call our cache for the month\n  - Do we have anything?\n\t    - Yes: Check the last date of the cache\n\t    - No: Fetch for the whole month\n- Receive a uncached response?\n\t- Yes: Save to Cache Manager","x":-251,"y":-60,"width":462,"height":240},
